cost efficient.

20
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:01,417
When we work on projects, we're always
taking a look at how we're managing things

21
00:01:01,417 --> 00:01:03,180
to see if we can be better.

22
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:06,708
One example I can give is just
taking notes—seems super simple, but

23
00:01:06,708 --> 00:01:10,740
