25
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:18,246
So we're constantly looking at new
ways to do things like take notes.

26
00:01:18,246 --> 00:01:21,820
How do we organize the skills and
the projects that we have?

27
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:25,268
So that's part of the process improvement
