30
00:01:31,944 --> 00:01:36,810
pushing ourselves, even if we feel like the product is at a good place to be better.

31
00:01:38,270 --> 00:01:41,110
Working with technology,
things are constantly changing,

32
00:01:41,110 --> 00:01:45,990
