38
00:01:59,690 --> 00:02:03,640
and so that's where that idea of
continuous improvement comes in.

39
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:07,488
Because even when you think it's great,
you need to be able to look at it,

40
00:02:07,488 --> 00:02:08,542
let your ego down, and

41
00:02:08,542 --> 00:02:12,960
