see how people are actually using it.

42
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:16,280
It's critical to technology
because it moves so fast.

43
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,490
Things change so quickly.

44
00:02:18,490 --> 00:02:21,454
If we aren't constantly improving
the things that we do or

45
00:02:21,454 --> 00:02:25,640
looking at the processes that we have,
we're going to get behind.

46
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,400
We're always adding new features,

47
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:31,170
